    415  f1db							; TitleIntro — intro-screen ($FD) edge check. Entered by JMP from DropStep
    416  f1db							; (no pending return; tail-jumps out — never rts, or it would pop a stale
    417  f1db							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    418  f1db							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    419  f1db							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
    420  f1db							; stack depth DropStep→TitleIntro→DropArm keeps sim_bomb_fuse min-SP).
    421  f1db							; Always re-samples StepsLeft (title-owned on intro/title frames;
    422  f1db							; RefreshEnemyY's idle-only guard never touches it during gameplay... its
    423  f1db							; gameplay latch writes StepsLeft only when DropTarget==0 — intro frames
    424  f1db							; have DropTarget=$FD so ownership stays clean).
    425  f1db							; Clobbers A/X/Temp. Ends at TitleTailAudio (silence + overscan wait).
    426  f1db							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
