    647  f560		       00 8f	   CollisionEndY =	$8F	; plan 5.1 punch: last row (ClearPFColumn contract)
    648  f560							; bank0's LineCount — do NOT confuse with bank1's Temp ($AD) HUD scratch above.
    649  f560							; ClearPFColumn's first-row arg — passed by BombMarkWalls (plan 5.1 punch),
    650  f560							; NOT Temp: EnterRoom no longer runs ClearPFColumn (restore deleted, D1-B)
    651  f560							; and the old mid-input constraint is gone. Dead in overscan otherwise —
