    708  f583							; Line 1: Timer bar — PF body, mid-scanline COLUPF yellow→red
    709  f583							; Full (BarLevel >= BAR_MAX-7 = 113..120): pure yellow, no red write.
    710  f583							; The 8-dec hold (bugs.md #30, 2026-10-11) delays the FIRST red until
    711  f583							; t=8s = exactly one chunk period (K=8), so the first red appears on
    712  f583							; the same cadence as every later chunk. Chunks are 3-4c (9-12px) so
